00:25:00.640 --> 00:25:00.840
I mean,

00:25:01.040 --> 00:25:04.046
part of our ethos and
part of our objective as a

00:25:04.070 --> 00:25:07.397
library is to make the
information that's contained

00:25:07.421 --> 00:25:10.294
