you have another job,

00:25:51.600 --> 00:25:56.160
which is you're building this new life
form that's going to take over the world,

00:25:56.320 --> 00:25:56.480
and

00:25:56.800 --> 00:25:59.200
Google is providing the
memories for its brain,

00:25:59.520 --> 00:26:01.120
or the other companies
are providing the memories.

00:26:01.120 --> 00:26:03.400
And this is something
that's openly talked about.

00:26:05.120 --> 00:26:06.800
It's all human knowledge,

00:26:07.440 --> 00:26:09.200
in books and out of books,

00:26:10.320 --> 00:26:11.320
woven together.

00:26:12.800 --> 00:26:16.600
Into a single entity that's
accessible by anybody,

00:26:16.680 --> 00:26:17.720
anywhere in the world,

00:26:17.760 --> 00:26:18.400
anytime.

00:26:19.120 --> 00:26:22.520
And that all knowledge
is transformative.

00:26:22.600 --> 00:26:27.080
It just really kicks up the civilization
in our society into another level.

00:26:29.080 --> 00:26:31.200
Shortly after the
