liability in the United States

00:42:23.560 --> 00:42:25.200
can be quite extreme,

00:42:25.200 --> 00:42:27.960
$150,000 per copyrighted work.

00:42:29.280 --> 00:42:32.000
And depending on the number
of copyrighted works at stake,

00:42:32.040 --> 00:42:33.840
it could be in the
billions of dollars.

00:42:35.280 --> 00:42:39.080
The Association of American Publishers
has filed a lawsuit against Google,

00:42:39.680 --> 00:42:43.716
