would violate copyright protections.

00:42:51.880 --> 00:42:54.640
I think the issue of
copyright is an archaic,

00:42:55.040 --> 00:42:58.120
unproductive view.

00:42:59.280 --> 00:43:00.480
When you create something,

00:43:00.760 --> 00:43:03.920
