work of other people,

00:43:03.920 --> 00:43:04.880
no matter who you are,

00:43:04.920 --> 00:43:05.480
whether you're

00:43:06.040 --> 00:43:07.640
J.K. Rowling or Shakespeare.

00:43:08.920 --> 00:43:12.200
You're basing your work
on the work of others.

00:43:12.280 --> 00:43:14.000
You're basically
taking their ideas.

00:43:14.520 --> 00:43:16.480
Artists does not
own their ideas.

00:43:16.960 --> 00:43:17.960
No artist does.

00:43:18.640 --> 00:43:20.920
Any useful information is...

00:43:21.240 --> 00:43:23.680
exists because of the
efforts of real people.

00:43:24.120 --> 00:43:27.240
Copyright is our way of
remembering who those people are.

00:43:28.880 --> 00:43:30.520
It's crucial to not lose that.

00:43:31.400 --> 00:43:34.640
I think cyber culture is
missing the point of copyright.

00:43:35.520 --> 00:43:35.920
You might say,

00:43:35.920 --> 00:43:36.040
well,

00:43:36.040 --> 00:43:36.960
