00:47:40.760 --> 00:47:41.720
and I don't want to go to jail.

00:47:42.760 --> 00:47:45.200
Google's long-running
legal battle with the U.S.

00:47:45.280 --> 00:47:50.088
publishing industry came to an unexpected
halt this morning as the parties announced

00:47:50.112 --> 00:47:54.920
