Google has already scammed.

00:48:15.800 --> 00:48:18.080
They will get
around $60 per book.

00:48:18.720 --> 00:48:20.280
The largest portion
of the settlement,

00:48:20.640 --> 00:48:22.240
$45.5 million,

00:48:22.600 --> 00:48:24.200
will go just on the legal fees.

00:48:25.040 --> 00:48:25.280
But

00:48:25.600 --> 00:48:30.040
The most striking aspect of the agreement
is that it turns Google into a bookseller,

00:48:30.440 --> 00:48:32.480
selling online
access to out of print,

00:48:32.800 --> 00:48:34.720
but still in copyright works.

00:48:35.000 --> 00:48:38.560
For those of you who don't know the
details of the settlement agreement,

00:48:38.800 --> 00:48:39.000
it's

00:48:39.600 --> 00:48:41.280
385 pages.

00:48:42.000 --> 00:48:44.080
It has 46 sections
of definitions.

00:48:44.120 --> 00:48:44.480
It's got

00:48:45.000 --> 00:48:47.080
15 sections on
Google's obligations.

00:48:47.080 --> 00:48:49.240
It's got nine sections
on the economic terms.

00:48:49.800 --> 00:48:52.720
It's got six sections
on libraries obligations.

00:48:53.160 --> 00:48:55.852
So this is not a little three
