01:12:48.360 --> 01:12:50.600
This is a fascinating
turning point,

01:12:50.720 --> 01:12:51.120
actually,

01:12:51.120 --> 01:12:55.080
in the whole history of knowledge
and of access to knowledge.

01:12:55.440 --> 01:12:57.828
And it was being
played out in a New York

01:12:57.852 --> 01:13:00.840
courtroom before Judge
Denny Chin in the Southern

01:13:01.240 --> 01:13:02.840
